(7056813, 1073806, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I wish there were more separation between the background and the hummingbird (more of a portrait feel), but beautiful none-the-less. It looks like you may have tried to do something like I''m suggesting but were wanting to keep it subtle. I''m curious what your background actually was. I hope this doesn''t get DQ''d for removing a background.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I wish there were more separation between the background and the hummingbird (more of a portrait feel), but beautiful none-the-less. It looks like you may have tried to do something like I''m suggesting but were wanting to keep it subtle. I''m curious what your background actually was. I hope this doesn''t get DQ''d for removing a background.', '2013-06-28 15:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7056815, 1073591, 60173, '<td valign="top">Poor mom is in dire need of attention, both love and medical. I hope you''ve found a way to help her.<br/> <br/>A well constructed and powerful image.</td>', 'Poor mom is in dire need of attention, both love and medical. I hope you''ve found a way to help her. A well constructed and powerful image.', '2013-06-28 15:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7056843, 1073784, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the color palette and the owl is magnificent.  Minor nit on the processing: I''d have dodged those subtle catchlights.  At first glance his eyes seem lifeless, and I think that extra emphasis on the eye detail would really bring out the intensity of his stare.</td>', 'I like the composition and the color palette and the owl is magnificent.  Minor nit on the processing: I''d have dodged those subtle catchlights.  At first glance his eyes seem lifeless, and I think that extra emphasis on the eye detail would really bring out the intensity of his stare.', '2013-06-28 16:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7056844, 1073594, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not your average mantis shot.  Extra point for originality!</td>', 'Not your average mantis shot.  Extra point for originality!', '2013-06-28 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
