(7057267, 1073781, 28427, '<td valign="top">Yet it invites to find out what''s behind the curve.  I hope you didn''t get into a storm, when I see the threatening clouds which were above you.  What I like the most: the sunset at the horizon in contrast with those clouds.  Great details as well.</td>', 'Yet it invites to find out what''s behind the curve.  I hope you didn''t get into a storm, when I see the threatening clouds which were above you.  What I like the most: the sunset at the horizon in contrast with those clouds.  Great details as well.', '2013-06-29 08:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
