(7057270, 1073591, 28427, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most difficult comments of the whole challenge.<br/>I hope I''m not offending you, but I''m heartbroken while watching this.<br/></td>', 'This is one of the most difficult comments of the whole challenge.I hope I''m not offending you, but I''m heartbroken while watching this.', '2013-06-29 08:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
