(7057275, 1073787, 114285, '<td valign="top">I just have an obsession with everything old, and those windmills, or turbines, are just amazing and really make this image work well, love the way you PP it as well, and extra points for the pooch!</td>', 'I just have an obsession with everything old, and those windmills, or turbines, are just amazing and really make this image work well, love the way you PP it as well, and extra points for the pooch!', '2013-06-29 09:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
