(7057277, 1073708, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love these creatures, but that shrub in the foreground is very distracting, but I guess if you got any closer maybe he would of come after you and eaten you alive ;---)</td>', 'I love these creatures, but that shrub in the foreground is very distracting, but I guess if you got any closer maybe he would of come after you and eaten you alive ;---)', '2013-06-29 09:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057278, 1073791, 28427, '<td valign="top">I love seeing a dog happy. They''re having a blast there.  Slightly hesitating on the sharpening rate but I''m not letting this interfere my score.  I love the overall view.</td>', 'I love seeing a dog happy. They''re having a blast there.  Slightly hesitating on the sharpening rate but I''m not letting this interfere my score.  I love the overall view.', '2013-06-29 09:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057279, 1073695, 114285, '<td valign="top">You know what is one of the saddest things about architects these days, is that they don''t design buildings to have character and charm like this one. It''s all about slapping a building together in record time without paying too much attention to detail, shame, I say a real shame.<br/> <br/> The light is so gorgeous and the furniture has so much charm, I can see why you posted this, it''s ROYAL!</td>', 'You know what is one of the saddest things about architects these days, is that they don''t design buildings to have character and charm like this one. It''s all about slapping a building together in record time without paying too much attention to detail, shame, I say a real shame.  The light is so gorgeous and the furniture has so much charm, I can see why you posted this, it''s ROYAL!', '2013-06-29 09:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057281, 1073726, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the comp, is it upside down, hmmm wonderful creature!</td>', 'Not sure about the comp, is it upside down, hmmm wonderful creature!', '2013-06-29 09:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
