(7057285, 1073616, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well who can give a photo like this a 5, or even a 6, NO what about a 7, don''t believe I could, how about an 8, not sure, I think it''s worth more than that, a 9, hmmmm maybe, but you know what I''m going to give it 10, for absolute 100% cute factor! All the best!<br/> <br/> <br/>Ohh and did I mention the eyes, WOW, those eyes!!!</td>', 'Well who can give a photo like this a 5, or even a 6, NO what about a 7, don''t believe I could, how about an 8, not sure, I think it''s worth more than that, a 9, hmmmm maybe, but you know what I''m going to give it 10, for absolute 100% cute factor! All the best!  Ohh and did I mention the eyes, WOW, those eyes!!!', '2013-06-29 09:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
