(7057813, 1073550, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Fantastic capture of this flying vehicle - love how the parachute sails are as colorful as a rainbow. The rainbow colors perfectly compliment the flying into the wild blue yonder of the composition. My only critiqe, and a small one at that, is that I think the vignetting on the edges is a bit heavy - mayhap it would be better to make it more subtle.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Fantastic capture of this flying vehicle - love how the parachute sails are as colorful as a rainbow. The rainbow colors perfectly compliment the flying into the wild blue yonder of the composition. My only critiqe, and a small one at that, is that I think the vignetting on the edges is a bit heavy - mayhap it would be better to make it more subtle.', '2013-06-29 21:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057814, 1073116, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice IR effect to this landscape, I love the tree especially. Really nice job with the composition of the frame and the contrasts throughout.</td>', 'Nice IR effect to this landscape, I love the tree especially. Really nice job with the composition of the frame and the contrasts throughout.', '2013-06-29 21:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
