(7057834, 1073410, 53200, '<td valign="top">When I win the lottery I''m coming to Africa to go shooting with you even if this looks way too scary :) - I am sooooo jealous.</td>', 'When I win the lottery I''m coming to Africa to go shooting with you even if this looks way too scary :) - I am sooooo jealous.', '2013-06-29 21:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
