(7057847, 1073809, 115814, '<td valign="top">Perfect title!</td>', 'Perfect title!', '2013-06-29 21:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057848, 1073741, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment and bump up.<br/> <br/>Your details in this run aground boat and the landscape around it is fabulous. The tones are very good and have a nice dynamic range. My suggestion to perhaps improve the visual impact of the photo is the choice of crop and where the main subject lies when further strengthening the mood of the piece. I like how the boat seems to be leaning away from the lake water in the backdrop. It is removed from the water and abandoned That mood of abandonment and shunned is something I feel should be played up. I suggest the boat dominated the bottom left quarter and far left edge of the photo. Then the lake stretches out to occupy the middle and right half of the photo. The empty stretch of lake and the boat sitting off in the far corner leaning to the left away from the water would then speak of emptiness and forlorn more strongly.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment and bump up. Your details in this run aground boat and the landscape around it is fabulous. The tones are very good and have a nice dynamic range. My suggestion to perhaps improve the visual impact of the photo is the choice of crop and where the main subject lies when further strengthening the mood of the piece. I like how the boat seems to be leaning away from the lake water in the backdrop. It is removed from the water and abandoned That mood of abandonment and shunned is something I feel should be played up. I suggest the boat dominated the bottom left quarter and far left edge of the photo. Then the lake stretches out to occupy the middle and right half of the photo. The empty stretch of lake and the boat sitting off in the far corner leaning to the left away from the water would then speak of emptiness and forlorn more strongly.', '2013-06-29 21:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057849, 1073050, 115814, '<td valign="top">So much to look at. Lines, colors, bokeh, The tack sharp focus softens quite a bit in the lower left portion of the flower. Powerful shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'So much to look at. Lines, colors, bokeh, The tack sharp focus softens quite a bit in the lower left portion of the flower. Powerful shot, nonetheless.', '2013-06-29 21:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057851, 1073678, 115814, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this round. The Polaroid look works well. Great lines and composition - lots to see without  drawing attention from the lower right subjects. Not sure the rough edge border adds much.</td>', 'One of my favorites this round. The Polaroid look works well. Great lines and composition - lots to see without  drawing attention from the lower right subjects. Not sure the rough edge border adds much.', '2013-06-29 21:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057852, 1073357, 47906, '<td valign="top">Its a lovely example of White on light portraits, I feel the blurring/smoothing of the face may have been a bit overdone in my opnion. I would love to see a bit more detail in the cheek bones and nasal area. <br/> <br/>I feel it would really pop if you did this.</td>', 'Its a lovely example of White on light portraits, I feel the blurring/smoothing of the face may have been a bit overdone in my opnion. I would love to see a bit more detail in the cheek bones and nasal area.  I feel it would really pop if you did this.', '2013-06-29 21:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057853, 1073543, 115814, '<td valign="top">The processing is really bold and effective. I wish there was a bit more detail in the brightest highlight in the mid upper right.</td>', 'The processing is really bold and effective. I wish there was a bit more detail in the brightest highlight in the mid upper right.', '2013-06-29 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057854, 1073594, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Lovely sunset colors and great silhouette of the praying mantis. The strong silhouette of this insect does take on the aspect of some eerie outer space creature. You have a good foundation to work with but the crop/zoom holds it back from it''s full potential. There is just too much ''empty'' space that does nothing to compliment the main subject of your photo. Your main subject is the insect creature so play it up and have it fill the screen more. Here it fills maybe 20% of the screen. Crop out the the left half and just above the antennae of the mantis so that it fills your audiences vision more and thus increase the visual impact of the photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Lovely sunset colors and great silhouette of the praying mantis. The strong silhouette of this insect does take on the aspect of some eerie outer space creature. You have a good foundation to work with but the crop/zoom holds it back from it''s full potential. There is just too much ''empty'' space that does nothing to compliment the main subject of your photo. Your main subject is the insect creature so play it up and have it fill the screen more. Here it fills maybe 20% of the screen. Crop out the the left half and just above the antennae of the mantis so that it fills your audiences vision more and thus increase the visual impact of the photo.', '2013-06-29 21:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057855, 1073439, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very nice timed capture of this falls. I think if you cropped off some of the rocks at the top of the frame and kept the amount that is approximately at the bottom it would make the falls more symmetrical about the right vertical line of the rule of thirds and make it a stronger composition overall. <br/> <br/>Beautiful detail in the stone walls about the waterfall.</td>', 'Very nice timed capture of this falls. I think if you cropped off some of the rocks at the top of the frame and kept the amount that is approximately at the bottom it would make the falls more symmetrical about the right vertical line of the rule of thirds and make it a stronger composition overall.  Beautiful detail in the stone walls about the waterfall.', '2013-06-29 21:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057857, 1073808, 115814, '<td valign="top">I always strive to be the less than negative one, too. This one is certainly less than negative. It caught my eye on the first pass though and kept making me stop and look. Nicely done.</td>', 'I always strive to be the less than negative one, too. This one is certainly less than negative. It caught my eye on the first pass though and kept making me stop and look. Nicely done.', '2013-06-29 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057858, 1073844, 47906, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great tribute to the duck hunter. I love the DOF on this and I also love the fact you have the dog in the background as the faithful companion.</td>', 'I think this is a great tribute to the duck hunter. I love the DOF on this and I also love the fact you have the dog in the background as the faithful companion.', '2013-06-29 21:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057861, 1073385, 47906, '<td valign="top">A valiant effort of HDR toning. It feels to me that it has a slight bluish hue color shift to it. Also beware of sharpening halos as there is one on the right sanddune of the frame.</td>', 'A valiant effort of HDR toning. It feels to me that it has a slight bluish hue color shift to it. Also beware of sharpening halos as there is one on the right sanddune of the frame.', '2013-06-29 21:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057862, 1073821, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I LOVE the action that is happening in this photo of two penguins. Their body postures invoke the thought that these two are having an argument. Fully riled up and angry the one on the left turns it''s back, throwing it''s beak up in contempt. The one on the right angry of being ignored and disrespected, stomps off in a huff. Raising it''s left wing in a ''arm'' gesture that speaks, "Forget you, I''m out of here.".</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I LOVE the action that is happening in this photo of two penguins. Their body postures invoke the thought that these two are having an argument. Fully riled up and angry the one on the left turns it''s back, throwing it''s beak up in contempt. The one on the right angry of being ignored and disrespected, stomps off in a huff. Raising it''s left wing in a ''arm'' gesture that speaks, "Forget you, I''m out of here.".', '2013-06-29 21:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057863, 1073054, 47906, '<td valign="top">Feels slightly off balanced, needs a 0.3 clockwise rotation of the horizon to realign the horizon.<br/> <br/>Great symmetry to this. Love the detail and the overall beauty.</td>', 'Feels slightly off balanced, needs a 0.3 clockwise rotation of the horizon to realign the horizon. Great symmetry to this. Love the detail and the overall beauty.', '2013-06-29 21:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057864, 1073691, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a fantastic portrait of this man. Great details and light that shows off the beard and the story of years on his face. I wonder what he is gazing at. Or maybe he is speaking with someone given that the lips are open like he has finished speaking a word. Well done on this portrait.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a fantastic portrait of this man. Great details and light that shows off the beard and the story of years on his face. I wonder what he is gazing at. Or maybe he is speaking with someone given that the lips are open like he has finished speaking a word. Well done on this portrait.', '2013-06-29 21:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7057898, 1073616, 23484, '<td valign="top">What an excellent pet portrait shot. Great job.</td>', 'What an excellent pet portrait shot. Great job.', '2013-06-29 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
