(7058172, 1073511, 103142, '<td valign="top">Really?? Cats I can understand -- dogs?? <br/> <br/>Fun catch. For some reason, I''m really wishing the front paws were all in the shot on this one. Probably because it looks like they''re about to raise up, and it makes the crop feel a little awkward. Still like it though -7-</td>', 'Really?? Cats I can understand -- dogs??  Fun catch. For some reason, I''m really wishing the front paws were all in the shot on this one. Probably because it looks like they''re about to raise up, and it makes the crop feel a little awkward. Still like it though -7-', '2013-06-30 21:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7058178, 1073532, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the crop and the processing on this one. It seems so close, yet just a little off. Maybe it''s the line coming out of the chin -- either the crop or the line seems to make the chin look particularly large. As for the processing, It''s just the particular pink of the lips that I''m not sure about -- otherwise, I''m finding the processing quite interesting. This seems really close -- just not quite right. -6-</td>', 'Not sure of the crop and the processing on this one. It seems so close, yet just a little off. Maybe it''s the line coming out of the chin -- either the crop or the line seems to make the chin look particularly large. As for the processing, It''s just the particular pink of the lips that I''m not sure about -- otherwise, I''m finding the processing quite interesting. This seems really close -- just not quite right. -6-', '2013-06-30 21:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7058181, 1073343, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that seems so close, yet not quite right. But I have a feeling this suffers with the 800 pixels and would be much better at 1200 or 1400.  I''m also curious what it would look like with a little less foreground. Just a tad less. -7-</td>', 'Another one that seems so close, yet not quite right. But I have a feeling this suffers with the 800 pixels and would be much better at 1200 or 1400.  I''m also curious what it would look like with a little less foreground. Just a tad less. -7-', '2013-06-30 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7058183, 1073849, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the glow treatment on the leg, but it seems a bit overdone on the bike and the shoe -- makes it look a little too soft. Nice idea -- just a bit overdone. -6-</td>', 'I like the glow treatment on the leg, but it seems a bit overdone on the bike and the shoe -- makes it look a little too soft. Nice idea -- just a bit overdone. -6-', '2013-06-30 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
