(7058249, 1073853, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great dynamic tones and wonderful details. There is a story here and it makes me wonder who this paired couple are. Body postures on both are stand offish but they seem to be together. She carries with her some flowers. Who is she going to see? Are these two a couple, friends or just two individuals going to/leaving the same destination. I get the sense they know each other but don''t always see eye to eye - and it seems that this day of the capture there is a disagreement between them. That is what story the photo speaks to me - will have to see later what the history/story rests in this one after rollover. That said - excellent work.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great dynamic tones and wonderful details. There is a story here and it makes me wonder who this paired couple are. Body postures on both are stand offish but they seem to be together. She carries with her some flowers. Who is she going to see? Are these two a couple, friends or just two individuals going to/leaving the same destination. I get the sense they know each other but don''t always see eye to eye - and it seems that this day of the capture there is a disagreement between them. That is what story the photo speaks to me - will have to see later what the history/story rests in this one after rollover. That said - excellent work.', '2013-07-01 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
