(7059235, 1073600, 72103, '<td valign="top">IMHO shots like this are better if geometrically symetrical, ie take the shot straight down the centre of road below..............  More impact I think - 6</td>', 'IMHO shots like this are better if geometrically symetrical, ie take the shot straight down the centre of road below..............  More impact I think - 6', '2013-07-02 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
