(7059247, 1073781, 72103, '<td valign="top">Id have included just a tad more sky, have teh top left running into the corner...  But nice understated HDR  ( I think ).....</td>', 'Id have included just a tad more sky, have teh top left running into the corner...  But nice understated HDR  ( I think ).....', '2013-07-02 11:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
