(7060093, 1073730, 28427, '<td valign="top">At first this photograph seems not showing a lot, but...when taking a closer look, there is so much going on.<br/>And each time I look at it again, I see new things.<br/>Like it very much<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-07-08 12:53:18.</i></td>', 'At first this photograph seems not showing a lot, but...when taking a closer look, there is so much going on.And each time I look at it again, I see new things.Like it very much', '2013-07-03 08:34:50.000000', '2013-07-08 13:53:18.000000', 1),
