(7060168, 1073613, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool (cold?) shot.</td>', 'Cool (cold?) shot.', '2013-07-03 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060171, 1073726, 65234, '<td valign="top">Look at all those legs!  And talk about flexible ;-)  Not sure I''d want him crawling on me (aren''t they poisonous?) but fascinating to see.</td>', 'Look at all those legs!  And talk about flexible ;-)  Not sure I''d want him crawling on me (aren''t they poisonous?) but fascinating to see.', '2013-07-03 10:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060172, 1073097, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  There better be some serious rain to counteract all that lightning.  Impressive image.</td>', 'Yikes!  There better be some serious rain to counteract all that lightning.  Impressive image.', '2013-07-03 10:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060175, 1073360, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.  For some reason I think I''d like to see the sky here, too.</td>', 'Lovely light.  For some reason I think I''d like to see the sky here, too.', '2013-07-03 10:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060178, 1073721, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, love those rays of sunlight!</td>', 'Oooh, love those rays of sunlight!', '2013-07-03 10:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060181, 1073693, 65234, '<td valign="top">A bit unnerving, this perspective!  I like the reflection.  I think I''d like a tad more DOF, too, to make those advancing front legs even more menacing, but I know spiders aren''t always cooperative enough to wait while you change camera settings.</td>', 'A bit unnerving, this perspective!  I like the reflection.  I think I''d like a tad more DOF, too, to make those advancing front legs even more menacing, but I know spiders aren''t always cooperative enough to wait while you change camera settings.', '2013-07-03 10:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060183, 1073788, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool shadow.  Kind of like that it''s headless.  Not so much impressed with the shoes ... if you could somehow get part of the barrel and the shadow and not the shoes it would have more impact for me.  But it''s still cool :-)</td>', 'Cool shadow.  Kind of like that it''s headless.  Not so much impressed with the shoes ... if you could somehow get part of the barrel and the shadow and not the shoes it would have more impact for me.  But it''s still cool :-)', '2013-07-03 10:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060184, 1073601, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very imposing.</td>', 'Very imposing.', '2013-07-03 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060186, 1073233, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Seems a bit flat to me, contrast-wise.  Or maybe I''m just too used to landscapes with more tonemapping to bring out the details.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Seems a bit flat to me, contrast-wise.  Or maybe I''m just too used to landscapes with more tonemapping to bring out the details.', '2013-07-03 10:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060187, 1073035, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.</td>', 'Lovely light.', '2013-07-03 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060188, 1073733, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting sense of scale.</td>', 'Interesting sense of scale.', '2013-07-03 10:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060190, 1073824, 65234, '<td valign="top">My, what big eyes he has!  Not sure what I think about the muted color.  I think B&amp;W might work better, but that''s me.</td>', 'My, what big eyes he has!  Not sure what I think about the muted color.  I think B&W might work better, but that''s me.', '2013-07-03 10:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060191, 1073842, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s having a bad face day.  Unless that''s a dancing person where his nose and mouth should be, in which case he''s having a very unusual face day.</td>', 'He''s having a bad face day.  Unless that''s a dancing person where his nose and mouth should be, in which case he''s having a very unusual face day.', '2013-07-03 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060192, 1073818, 65234, '<td valign="top">The look on the child''s face is priceless!  I wonder if a tight crop on just the child would be even more amusing?</td>', 'The look on the child''s face is priceless!  I wonder if a tight crop on just the child would be even more amusing?', '2013-07-03 10:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060193, 1073826, 65234, '<td valign="top">That she may be.  The focus looks to be somewhere behind her ... not sure where I expect it to be.  Maybe on the reflection?</td>', 'That she may be.  The focus looks to be somewhere behind her ... not sure where I expect it to be.  Maybe on the reflection?', '2013-07-03 10:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060263, 1073548, 28427, '<td valign="top">That stare...like he''s hypnotizing you, us...<br/>All those details in the feathers and down are wonderful.  Perfectly lit, the reflection in his eyes.  An amazing picture.</td>', 'That stare...like he''s hypnotizing you, us...All those details in the feathers and down are wonderful.  Perfectly lit, the reflection in his eyes.  An amazing picture.', '2013-07-03 14:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060396, 1073808, 72103, '<td valign="top">LIke it ........... 8</td>', 'LIke it ........... 8', '2013-07-03 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060397, 1073114, 124815, '<td valign="top">since we''ll have a challenge about titles, I must say that I object to this picture''s elevated one. <br/>It''s crystal clear that we deal with a poor scrawny bird totally baffled by the lack of small fry considering its filiform neck!<br/>Such a funny shot!</td>', 'since we''ll have a challenge about titles, I must say that I object to this picture''s elevated one. It''s crystal clear that we deal with a poor scrawny bird totally baffled by the lack of small fry considering its filiform neck!Such a funny shot!', '2013-07-03 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
