(7060888, 1073598, 114285, '<td valign="top">Who wouldn''t like this castle, it''s so majestic in all it''s grandeur. It''s also elegantly photographed in a brilliant minimalistic scene, the water looks shimmering silver, the mist, and the fact that there is not a cloud in the sky, or is it just over cast, anyway who cares, it all adds to the overall simplicity.  The PP is just perfect could not of done this any better myself.<br/> <br/>I''m going to give you this Verineat <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1070026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg"/></a> because it''s awarded to those images which make me sigh, and since I will be heading off to Europe In September this image makes me all the more excited!!!<br/> <br/>All the best, should ribbon.</td>', 'Who wouldn''t like this castle, it''s so majestic in all it''s grandeur. It''s also elegantly photographed in a brilliant minimalistic scene, the water looks shimmering silver, the mist, and the fact that there is not a cloud in the sky, or is it just over cast, anyway who cares, it all adds to the overall simplicity.  The PP is just perfect could not of done this any better myself. I''m going to give you this Verineat  because it''s awarded to those images which make me sigh, and since I will be heading off to Europe In September this image makes me all the more excited!!! All the best, should ribbon.', '2013-07-05 00:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060889, 1073837, 50695, '<td valign="top">Christ-like</td>', 'Christ-like', '2013-07-05 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7060890, 1073022, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>This photo makes me think of the phrase "shoot for the moon". That trail certainly blazes across the night sky. Nice details on the crescent moon. Three small suggestions that I think would help increase the visual appeal of the shot even more. First is that there is a lot of ''red'' noise splotches in the dark blue sky. A good Denoise program could get rid of that - Topaz Denoise has a clean color feature. Second, I''d crop out the bottom right up to the start of the trail. That way the trail would begin from the bottom left corner and not only show the exact starting point of the journey but be a leading line that the eye follows. Lastly, I think the title could be better to compliment the photo:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  This photo makes me think of the phrase "shoot for the moon". That trail certainly blazes across the night sky. Nice details on the crescent moon. Three small suggestions that I think would help increase the visual appeal of the shot even more. First is that there is a lot of ''red'' noise splotches in the dark blue sky. A good Denoise program could get rid of that - Topaz Denoise has a clean color feature. Second, I''d crop out the bottom right up to the start of the trail. That way the trail would begin from the bottom left corner and not only show the exact starting point of the journey but be a leading line that the eye follows. Lastly, I think the title could be better to compliment the photo:-)', '2013-07-05 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
