(7060942, 1073836, 157380, '<td valign="top">When an images style is recognisably by an individual, the image can be placed into a collection of works. This is interesting to me because it gives this image context that would be unavailable if were truly anonymous.  In this case, Even if it turns out not to be our great Jagar, the collection of work by the artist have given me an appreciation of what we are looking at here. :D</td>', 'When an images style is recognisably by an individual, the image can be placed into a collection of works. This is interesting to me because it gives this image context that would be unavailable if were truly anonymous.  In this case, Even if it turns out not to be our great Jagar, the collection of work by the artist have given me an appreciation of what we are looking at here. :D', '2013-07-05 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
