(7060995, 1073768, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Robert - you rock, and the PP, is awesome!<br/> <br/>Tell me about it Sliver Effex and CEP, a bit of glam glow I reckon?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The conversion is SEP2, yes. The painterly effect is derived from Topaz Simplify''s "buzz sim" setting, tweaked quite a bit. There''s a touch of Color Efex Pro, "darken/lighten center" and a little "pro contrast", no glam glow. Topaz Simplify made it glow.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Robert - you rock, and the PP, is awesome! Tell me about it Sliver Effex and CEP, a bit of glam glow I reckon??  The conversion is SEP2, yes. The painterly effect is derived from Topaz Simplify''s "buzz sim" setting, tweaked quite a bit. There''s a touch of Color Efex Pro, "darken/lighten center" and a little "pro contrast", no glam glow. Topaz Simplify made it glow.', '2013-07-05 01:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
