(7060999, 1073325, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hello, just wanted to be honest I gave you a 6, I didn''t even notice he was homeless to tell the truth, I didn''t look at his glasses long enough to see, so I guess the 1 second voters wouldn''t of had enough time as well, also the PP was a little over done, his skin looks very smooth IMHO!</td>', 'Hello, just wanted to be honest I gave you a 6, I didn''t even notice he was homeless to tell the truth, I didn''t look at his glasses long enough to see, so I guess the 1 second voters wouldn''t of had enough time as well, also the PP was a little over done, his skin looks very smooth IMHO!', '2013-07-05 02:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7061001, 1073325, 18505, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of another one of your portraits you titled "The Eccentric" <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=167372" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/329/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_167372.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/329/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_167372.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/329/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_167372.jpg"/></a> which has always been one of my favorites.  <br/> <br/>The difference in this current portrait is the despair... This man does not seem to see a future beyond his existence today.  I think it is an amazing capture.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This reminds me of another one of your portraits you titled "The Eccentric"  which has always been one of my favorites.   The difference in this current portrait is the despair... This man does not seem to see a future beyond his existence today.  I think it is an amazing capture. ', '2013-07-05 02:41:56.000000', NULL, 0),
